- Costs & fees
  - If we settle, can we recover attorney fees or costs? Should that be part of the negotiation?
  - If the respondent pays in installments and later defaults, what’s our cost to enforce and can they be ordered to pay enforcement costs?
- Confidentiality & public record
  - If confidentiality is important, how to draft secrecy provisions without violating public filing requirements? (Ask about sealing procedures.)
- Conflicts & communications
  - Any conflicts of interest with co-counsel or third parties? Who will be the primary contact at your firm?
